    1924,
    'Selous Game Reserve',
    'Natural',
    'Africa',
    'United Republic of Tanzania',
    'Large numbers of elephants, black rhinoceroses, cheetahs, giraffes, hippopotamuses and crocodiles live in this immense sanctuary, which measures 50,000 km 2 and is relatively undisturbed by human impact. The park has a variety of vegetation zones, ranging from dense thickets to open wooded grasslands.',
    NULL,
